setting-context-size = Context size
setting-context-size-desc = Number of tokens the model can keep in context. Higher uses more memory.
setting-gpu-layers = GPU layers
setting-gpu-layers-desc = How many model layers run on the GPU. 0 keeps everything on the CPU.
setting-threads = CPU threads
setting-threads-desc = Threads used for generation. -1 lets the backend decide.
setting-batch-size = Batch size
setting-batch-size-desc = Logical batch size for prompt processing. Larger is faster but uses more memory.
setting-flash-attention = Flash attention
setting-flash-attention-desc = Faster attention implementation. Auto lets the backend choose.
setting-parallel = Parallel slots
setting-parallel-desc = How many requests the server handles at the same time.
setting-mmap = Memory-map model
setting-mmap-desc = Load the model through memory mapping. Disable it if startup is slow.
setting-mlock = Lock in RAM
setting-mlock-desc = Prevents the system from swapping the model to disk.
setting-temperature = Temperature
setting-temperature-desc = Randomness of the output. Lower is more deterministic.
setting-top-p = Top-p
setting-top-p-desc = Nucleus sampling threshold. Lower keeps more likely tokens.
setting-ubatch-size = Micro-batch size
setting-ubatch-size-desc = Physical micro-batch size. Lower reduces peak memory.
setting-threads-batch = Batch threads
setting-threads-batch-desc = Threads used while processing the prompt.
setting-cpu-affinity = CPU affinity
setting-cpu-affinity-desc = Automatically pin CPU workers to physical P-cores on hybrid CPUs (Linux only).
setting-numa = NUMA mode
setting-numa-desc = NUMA optimization strategy for multi-socket or multi-node systems.
setting-process-priority = Process priority
setting-process-priority-desc = OS priority of the backend process. Higher can be smoother but greedier.
setting-tensor-split = Tensor split
setting-tensor-split-desc = Comma-separated proportion of layers per GPU, for example "0.5,0.5".
setting-main-gpu = Main GPU
setting-main-gpu-desc = Index of the GPU used as the primary device.
setting-split-mode = Split mode
setting-split-mode-desc = How layers are split across multiple GPUs.
setting-kv-offload = KV cache on GPU
setting-kv-offload-desc = Keep the KV cache on the GPU when layers are offloaded.
setting-cache-type-k = K cache type
setting-cache-type-k-desc = Precision of the key cache. Lower precision saves memory.
setting-cache-type-v = V cache type
setting-cache-type-v-desc = Precision of the value cache. Lower precision saves memory.
setting-continuous-batching = Continuous batching
setting-continuous-batching-desc = Process new requests while others are still generating.
setting-seed = Seed
setting-seed-desc = Random seed for sampling. -1 picks a new one each time.
setting-top-k = Top-k
setting-top-k-desc = Keep only the k most likely tokens. 0 disables the limit.
setting-min-p = Min-p
setting-min-p-desc = Drop tokens below this relative probability.
setting-repeat-penalty = Repeat penalty
setting-repeat-penalty-desc = Penalize repeated tokens. 1.0 disables the penalty.
manage-memory-estimate = Memory estimate — RAM ≈ { $ram } · VRAM ≈ { $vram }
manage-advanced = Advanced settings
setting-cpu-range = CPU range
setting-cpu-range-desc = Restrict worker threads to a CPU range, for example "0-7".
setting-repack = Weight repacking
setting-repack-desc = Repack weights for faster generation. Supported types vary by backend.
setting-merge-qkv = Merge QKV
setting-merge-qkv-desc = ik_llama only: merge the Q, K and V projections to speed up attention.
setting-draft-model = Draft model
setting-draft-model-desc = Smaller model used for speculative decoding.
setting-draft-gpu-layers = Draft GPU layers
setting-draft-gpu-layers-desc = Layers of the draft model offloaded to the GPU.
setting-draft-context-size = Draft context size
setting-draft-context-size-desc = Context size for the draft model. 0 inherits the main model context.
setting-draft-max = Max draft tokens
setting-draft-max-desc = Maximum number of tokens proposed per speculative step.
setting-draft-cache-type-k = Draft K cache type
setting-draft-cache-type-k-desc = Precision of the draft model key cache.
setting-draft-cache-type-v = Draft V cache type
setting-draft-cache-type-v-desc = Precision of the draft model value cache.
setting-draft-threads = Draft threads
setting-draft-threads-desc = CPU threads used by the draft model.
setting-mmproj = Multimodal projector
setting-mmproj-desc = Path to the mmproj file used for vision or audio input.
setting-mmproj-offload = Projector on GPU
setting-mmproj-offload-desc = Offload the multimodal projector to the GPU.
setting-image-min-tokens = Minimum image tokens
setting-image-min-tokens-desc = Minimum tokens per image for vision models with dynamic resolution.
setting-image-max-tokens = Maximum image tokens
setting-image-max-tokens-desc = Maximum tokens per image for vision models with dynamic resolution.
setting-mtp-requantize = MTP output quant
setting-mtp-requantize-desc = ik_llama only: quantize the MTP output tensor to this type.
setting-spec-type = Speculation type
setting-spec-type-desc = First stage of speculation; some types use a draft file.
