setting-spec-n-max-desc = Maximum tokens proposed per speculative step.
setting-spec-n-min = Min speculative tokens
setting-spec-n-min-desc = Minimum tokens proposed per speculative step.
setting-spec-p-min = Min speculative probability
setting-spec-p-min-desc = Minimum probability for a speculative token to be used.
setting-spec-heads = MTP heads
setting-spec-heads-desc = Number of heads used by multi-token prediction.
setting-spec-ngram-size-n = N-gram size N
setting-spec-ngram-size-n-desc = Context length used to look up n-gram matches.
setting-spec-ngram-size-m = N-gram size M
setting-spec-ngram-size-m-desc = Length of the n-gram continuation to predict.
setting-spec-ngram-min-hits = N-gram min hits
setting-spec-ngram-min-hits-desc = Minimum occurrences before an n-gram is used.
setting-spec-suffix-min-match-len = Suffix min match
setting-spec-suffix-min-match-len-desc = Minimum suffix match length before proposing tokens.
setting-spec-suffix-max-depth = Suffix max depth
setting-spec-suffix-max-depth-desc = Maximum depth explored for suffix matches.
setting-spec-suffix-corpus = Suffix corpus
setting-spec-suffix-corpus-desc = Optional corpus file used by suffix decoding.
